In so far as the Department of National Health and Welfare is concerned: (a) Not applicable; (b) Not applicable;
(c)	National Advisory Council on Fitness and Amateur Sport, (i) Chairman; (ii) National Advisory Council on Fitness and Amateur Sport; (iii) January 1969 to present;
(iv)	Appointment; (v) Governor in Council (Order in Council, Privy Council 1969-12/531 dated March 18, 1969). Director, Canada Development Corporation Appointment by Governor in Council (see sections 4 and 5, CDC Act). In so far as the National Design Council is concerned: (a) Not applicable; (b) Not applicable; (c) National Design Council, Department of Industry, Trade and Commerce.
(i)	Member of the National Design Council; (ii) National Design Council; (iii) May 29, 1968 to May 29, 1971; (iv) Position attained by Order of the Governor-General in Council; (v) See item (iv).
